@startuml
title HTTP Middleware Chain
class ExceptionHandlingMiddleware
class RequestLoggingMiddleware
class RequestDelegate
class ControllerPipeline

ExceptionHandlingMiddleware --> RequestDelegate : _next(context)
RequestLoggingMiddleware --> RequestDelegate : _next(context)
ExceptionHandlingMiddleware --> RequestLoggingMiddleware : pipeline order
RequestLoggingMiddleware --> ControllerPipeline : next
@enduml
